  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hé, toi ! T’es de la Team MZ, non ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800E9002C00200074006F006900200021002000542019006500730020006400650020006C00610020005400650061006D0020004D005A002C0020006E006F006E0020003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Votre truc, c’est d’aider les gens, non ?\nEt bah moi, j’ai besoin d’aide, alors dis « OUI » !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "OUI !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00550049002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh... oui... ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002E002E002E0020006F00750069002E002E002E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parfait !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005000610072006600610069007400200021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Écoute. Y a comme des hurlements qui viennent\ndes égouts, là.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C90063006F007500740065002E002000590020006100200063006F006D006D006500200064006500730020006800750072006C0065006D0065006E0074007300200071007500690020007600690065006E006E0065006E0074000A006400650073002000E90067006F007500740073002C0020006C00E0002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’pense qu’il faudrait que quelqu’un aille y jeter\nun œil, mais on m’a dit qu’il y avait des Pokémon<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde type Spectre, là-dedans...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 138
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et vu qu’le boss dit que vous êtes forts, j’me suis\ndit que ce serait plus simple de vous demander.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais va pas croire que c’est parce que\nj’ai les jetons, OK ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006900730020007600610020007000610073002000630072006F00690072006500200071007500650020006320190065007300740020007000610072006300650020007100750065000A006A2019006100690020006C006500730020006A00650074006F006E0073002C0020004F004B0020003F0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’es fort<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe, pas vrai ? Alors, aide-moi, steuplé !\nT’as qu’à te dire que c’est pour sauver la ville !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 110
    },
