      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200054007500740061006E006B00610066006500720020006100200064006900730070006100720075002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avant de disparaître, il a laissé tomber\nquelque chose...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100760061006E00740020006400650020006400690073007000610072006100EE007400720065002C00200069006C002000610020006C006100690073007300E900200074006F006D006200650072000A007100750065006C007100750065002000630068006F00730065002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La présence de Tutankafer est toujours\nperceptible dans les égouts...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 5120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006100200070007200E900730065006E0063006500200064006500200054007500740061006E006B0061006600650072002000650073007400200074006F0075006A006F007500720073000A007000650072006300650070007400690062006C0065002000640061006E00730020006C00650073002000E90067006F007500740073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿6",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 5260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes yeux !!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 5272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065007300200079006500750078002000210021002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tout va bien ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006F007500740020007600610020006200690065006E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Que vous est-il arrivé ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006500200076006F007500730020006500730074002D0069006C00200061007200720069007600E90020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ha ha, vous allez rire...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nQuand j’ai trouvé ce Tutankafer, un Pokémon si\nrare à Illumis, je n’ai pas pu m’empêcher de crier !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je crois que le Tutankafer n’a pas trop\napprécié d’être dérangé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 5660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... et il a fini par m’enfermer dans son corps !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 5812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200065007400200069006C00200061002000660069006E006900200070006100720020006D20190065006E006600650072006D00650072002000640061006E007300200073006F006E00200063006F0072007000730020002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était si confortable à l’intérieur que je me suis\nsenti partir dans un profond sommeil...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 5920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci infiniment de m’avoir sorti de là !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 6112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006500720063006900200069006E00660069006E0069006D0065006E00740020006400650020006D201900610076006F0069007200200073006F0072007400690020006400650020006C00E00020002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a peut-être des gens enfermés dans\nces Tutankafer, tu crois pas ?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nVite, il faut tous les trouver !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿@",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ouaaah...\nBien joué ! On a assuré !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F00750061006100610068002E002E002E000A004200690065006E0020006A006F007500E9002000210020004F006E0020006100200061007300730075007200E900200021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "L’auteur de ces cris est sain et sauf, et on peut\ndire que c’est grâce à moi !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 6512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et puis, je t’ai permis de sauver un habitant\nd’Illumis de plus ! C’est pas beau, ça ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 6680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu peux vraiment me dire merci. Qu’est-ce que\nt’aurais fait si j’avais pas été là ? Ha ha !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 6864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Derrière toi...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 7056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006500720072006900E80072006500200074006F0069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Un Tutankafer !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 7088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E00200054007500740061006E006B0061006600650072002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein... ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
